6. H8 v6 per-bounce segmentation (commit 7654edb) — NEGATIVE. Apex detection is too coarse to isolate clean parabolic segments within long tracklets. v6 produces the same YouTube result as v5.

7. Summary docs (commits 7689ad5, 6d7b5b7) — Final summary report of all H1-H12 work.

All artifacts (scripts, data, contact sheets, reports) committed and pushed to origin/experiments/hand-occlusion-overnight. 7 new commits this episode, 2 NEGATIVE results clearly documented, 1 new recommended operating point (H10 v5), and 1 open problem (YouTube long-tracklet physics) now better-characterized.
